# Yogurt Dill Sauce

Similar to something like [https://minimalistbaker.com/zesty-dill-yogurt-sauce](https://minimalistbaker.com/zesty-dill-yogurt-sauce) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20250725170728/https://minimalistbaker.com/zesty-dill-yogurt-sauce/))

{ rating="4" image="sauce_yogurt_dill.jpeg" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

- [ ] 1 cup [Yogurt]{ ing="yogurt" }
- [ ] 2 Tbsp [Dried Dill]{ ing="dried-dill" }
- [ ] 2 Tbsp [Lemon juice]{ ing="lemon-juice" }
- [ ] 5 [Garlic Cloves]{ ing="garlic-cloves" }, minced
- [ ] 1/2 tsp [Salt]{ ing="salt" }
- [ ] (Optional) 1/2 tsp [Cayenne Pepper]{ ing="cayenne-pepper" }
- [ ] (Optional) [drizzle of Olive Oil]{ ing="drizzle-of-olive-oil" }

## Recipe

1. Mix and store in the fridge for at most a few days

## Notes

- Great with fish and as a sandwich
